<section style="margin-top: 32px;">
  <h3 style="margin: 0 0 6px;">
    Recent activity
    <span class="muted" style="font-weight: normal; font-size: 13px;">(<%= sessionGroups.length %> job<%= sessionGroups.length === 1 ? '' : 's' %> in last 14 days)</span>
  </h3>
  <p class="muted" style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 12px;">
    Each job is one cron run or one UI action. <strong>Undo job</strong> reverses every successful operation in that job in one batch — granular per-row undo isn't surfaced because <%= label %> jobs usually share intent and rolling back partial state would be more confusing than helpful.
  </p>
  <% if (sessionGroups.length === 0) { %>
    <p class="muted">No <%= label %> activity in the last 14 days.</p>
  <% } else { %>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th style="width: 160px;">Started (UTC)</th>
          <th style="width: 220px;">Caller / targets</th>
          <th>Operations</th>
          <th style="width: 140px;">Status</th>
          <th style="width: 110px;">Action</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <% sessionGroups.forEach((group) => { %>
          <%- include("./_session-group", { group }) %>
        <% }); %>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  <% } %>
</section>
